### List languages
GET http://localhost:5000/api/languages?page=1&limit=10

### Search languages
GET http://localhost:5000/api/languages?q=Hindi

### Get one
GET http://localhost:5000/api/languages/languages-1

### Create (admin token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/languages
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "English",
  "code": "en"
}
